Budget Buddy

Budget Buddy is a modern C-Sharp Windows Forms expense tracking and financial management desktop application designed for everyday budgeting, bill tracking, and financial oversight.

Key Features

-- Secure Authentication and Account Security: User registration featuring email OTP verification, BCrypt password hashing, and secure session handling.
-- Interactive Financial Dashboard: Real-time remaining budget summaries, automated bill alert notifications via native Windows system tray integration, and dynamic income and expense breakdown pie charts.
-- Expense and Income Tracking: Seamlessly add, update, delete, and export transaction records with automatic color-coded formatting.
-- Custom Category Management: Create, manage, and filter transactions by custom expense and income categories.
-- Strict 3NF Database Normalization: Built on a robust, normalized relational MySQL database schema ensuring data integrity, historical auditing, and optimal performance.

Tech Stack

-- Language: C#
-- Framework: .NET, Windows Forms
-- Database: MySQL

